  recipeId: control
  concept: 'Authored objective: Recover W035 feedback and requalify.

    Authored
    requirement: Interrupt W035 with power on, confirm that the load is inhibited,
    restore feedback, reset the latch, and qualify again.

    General teaching principle:
    A feedback controller compares measured behavior with a reference and acts subject
    to plant dynamics and limits.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence can
    establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: Steering toward a target works only if the feedback accurately describes
    where you are.
  diagram: '[Authored setup] -> [Check prerequisites] -> [Observe the game evidence]
    -> [Verify objective]'
  misconception: Improved command tracking in one condition does not establish stability
    under disturbances.
