    component, reference or condition mentioned in the authored requirement should
    you inspect first? Explain your reasoning."
  prediction: "For \u2018Recover W035 feedback and requalify\u2019, what result or
    observation would you expect if the required setup is correct? Distinguish a
    predicted result from a measured result."
  practice: "In Level 94, perform the objective \u2018Recover W035 feedback and requalify\u2019
    in the actual game laboratory. Compare fresh evidence against: Interrupt W035
    with power on, confirm that the load is inhibited, restore feedback, reset the
    latch, and qualify again.\nThe mission evaluator decides completion; this tutorial
    does not grade your answer."
